# Provenance of schema/schema.graphql (hadron-cli#2043, retire with #2658).
#
# The snapshot is NOT an export of a commit on hadron-server main. It is the
# export of the merge of these two named hadron-server commits, because the
# CLI needs hadron-server#4219 (the S4+S6 renames) and #4414
# (workedFromRoleTaskRefs) but cannot yet regenerate against S2 (#4513, which
# removed fields the old-shape decision.graphql selects).
#
# scripts/pin-server-sdl.sh reproduces that merge byte-deterministically, and
# its --verify checks the export against merge_sha/sdl_sha256/sdl_lines below
# and against the committed snapshot. The nightly schema-drift job checks the
# pin the same way (its pin-verify job); the drift job proper does something
# else: it compares the snapshot against hadron-server main, which the pin
# deliberately differs from until #2658 retires it.
#
# head= is the commit merged INTO base= (the merge's second parent), not the
# resulting merge commit — whose SHA the script reproduces deterministically
# and records as merge_sha=.
